Isa 48:1 , God, to convince the people of their foreknown obstinancy, revealed his prophecies;
Isa 48:9 , He saves them for his own sake;
Isa 48:12 , He exhorts them to obedience, because of his power and providence;
Isa 48:16 , He laments their backwardness;
Isa 48:20 , He powerfully delivers his people out of Babylon.
